---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import AboutSubnav from "@/components/about/AboutSubnav.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "Learn about Gurdwara Singh Sabha Richardson and its services.",
	title: "About — Gurdwara Singh Sabha of North Texas",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<AboutSubnav />
	<div class="mb-8">
		<h1 class="mb-6 text-center text-3xl font-bold">About Gurdwara Singh Sabha of North Texas</h1>

		<div class="mb-8">
			<p class="mb-4 text-lg">
				Since 1984, Gurdwara Singh Sabha of North Texas has welcomed the Sikh community of Richardson and the
				broader Dallas–Fort Worth region. Week after week the sangat gathers for prayer and kirtan, for
				Gurbani and Punjabi classes for children and adults, for langar and programs that keep families and
				neighbors connected—including sports and recreational activities on our grounds.
			</p>

			<p class="mb-6 text-lg">On an ordinary week you might join us for:</p>

			<ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-4">
				<li>
					<strong>Sikhi School:</strong> Lessons in Gurbani, Punjabi, and Sikh history and values for
					children and adults.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Langar kitchen:</strong> Vegetarian meals, no charge, offered by sewadars to every guest.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Recreational facilities:</strong> Space for athletics and programs that bring families and
					friends together.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<!-- Image Section -->
		<div class="mb-8">
			<h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Gallery</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
				<img
					src="/assets/images/MainHall.jpg"
					alt="Gurdwara Main Hall"
					class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg"
				/>
				<img
					src="/assets/images/Langar.jpg"
					alt="Langar Hall"
					class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg"
				/>
				<img
					src="/assets/images/MainHallScreen.jpg"
					alt="Community Event"
					class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>

		<blockquote class="my-6 border-l-4 border-accent-one pl-4 italic">
			"ਵਿਚਿ ਦੁਨੀਆ ਸੇਵ ਕਮਾਈਐ ॥<br />
			ਤਾ ਦਰਗਹ ਬੈਸਣੁ ਪਾਈਐ ॥"
			<br />
			<span class="mt-2 block text-sm">
				"In the midst of this world, do seva, and you shall be given a place of honor in the Court of
				the Lord." - Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji
			</span>
		</blockquote>

		<div class="mb-8">
			<h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Visit Us</h2>
			<p class="mb-4 text-lg">Address:</p>
			<address class="text-lg font-semibold">1201 Abrams Rd, Richardson, TX 75081</address>
			<p class="mt-4 text-lg">
				Whether it is your first diwan or a return visit, you are welcome at langar and community events. For
				questions ahead of time, the <a href="/contact" class="text-accent-one underline">contact page</a> reaches
				the office and sewadars.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
